#. Key: ArcEveAR01_00
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Arakune
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: 何　か　察知された　　　な　　くるな。　だ？
msgctxt "ArcEveAR01_00"
msgid "I  seems I     been de     ted     Some         com    . Who?"
msgstr "Сх же,    пом т ли. Хт сь і е. Хто?"

#. Key: ArcEveAR01_01
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: まぁて待て待て待て待て待て待て待て待てむぁぁてぇぇぇぇい！！！
msgctxt "ArcEveAR01_01"
msgid ""
"Waaait, wait wait wait wait wait! \n"
"I said waaaaaaait!"
msgstr ""
"Стрива-а-ай, стій, стій, стій, стій, стій, стій, стій! Я сказав:\n"
"стрива-а-а-а-ай!!!"

#. Key: ArcEveAR01_02
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: 誰が呼んだか正義の味方、呼ばれなくとも正義の味方、
#. JA:   階層都市カグツチの夢と平和と秩序を守る、
msgctxt "ArcEveAR01_02"
msgid ""
"Did someone call for a superhero? No matter!\n"
"A superhero has arrived! The protector of the peace,\n"
"dreams, and order of Kagutsuchi is here!"
msgstr ""
"Хтось кликав борця за справедливість? Не кликав —\n"
"однаково прийшов! Захисник мрій, миру й порядку\n"
"ієрархічного міста Каґуцучі..."

#. Key: ArcEveAR01_03
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: 熱き血潮に滾る男「シシガミ＝バング」、ここに見参！！
msgctxt "ArcEveAR01_03"
msgid ""
"Bang Shishigami, a man whose passion burns whenever \n"
"there's battle around, has arrived!"
msgstr ""
"Ось він — муж, у чиїх жилах кипить гаряча кров, Банґ\n"
"Шішіґамі! Я прибув!!"

#. Key: ArcEveAR01_04
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: お主は「アラクネ」に相違ないでござるか！
msgctxt "ArcEveAR01_04"
msgid "You must be Arakune!"
msgstr "Ти, без сумніву, Аракуне!"

#. Key: ArcEveAR01_05
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Arakune
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: フシッ　　キサマ　低脳　匂い　　　な。
#. JA:   う　　　　関　　　くない　　。
msgctxt "ArcEveAR01_05"
msgid ""
"Hiss    Yo   smell            im   cile.\n"
"Hmm        rather not      involve    ."
msgstr "Фс-с... Від те е тхне недо мком. М-м... Не хо у зв'язу атися."

#. Key: ArcEveAR01_06
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: むむむむ、聞くまでもなかったか。
msgctxt "ArcEveAR01_06"
msgid "Hmmm. I guess I didn't even have to ask."
msgstr "Гм-м-м, можна було й не питати."

#. Key: ArcEveAR01_07
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: その3筆で事足りる単純にして面妖な面構え、この人相描きとまるで
#. JA:   ジャストでござるな。カグツチの住民を襲う物の怪め！！
msgctxt "ArcEveAR01_07"
msgid ""
"That simple yet strange expression. Those looks.\n"
"You must be him. The evil ghost who attacks the residents\n"
"of Kagutsuchi!"
msgstr ""
"Твою просту й водночас дивовижну пику можна\n"
"намалювати трьома рисками — точнісінько як на цьому\n"
"портреті. Потворо, що нападаєш на мешканців Каґуцучі!!"

#. Key: ArcEveAR01_08
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: いかに奇妙な妖術を使おうと、この千里先の針の穴をも見通す
#. JA:   この双眼からは逃げ切れぬぞ！
msgctxt "ArcEveAR01_08"
msgid ""
"No matter what strange sorcery you may use, you cannot\n"
"escape my sight!"
msgstr ""
"Хай які дивні чари ти застосуєш, тобі не втекти від цих\n"
"очей, що здатні розгледіти вушко голки за тисячу рі!"

#. Key: ArcEveAR01_09
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: 今日がお主の悪事の命日！このバング様が成敗してくれる！！
msgctxt "ArcEveAR01_09"
msgid ""
"Today your evil deeds shall end!\n"
"I, Sir Bang, will punish you!"
msgstr ""
"Сьогодні твоїм злодіянням настане кінець! Я, великий\n"
"Банґ, покараю тебе!!"

#. Key: ArcEveAR01_10
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Arakune
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: 妙　赤い　　　。　　　　うるさい　　　　　　。
msgctxt "ArcEveAR01_10"
msgid "       oddly red.                                          really loud..."
msgstr "Ди но черво ий. І    галас ивий."

#. Key: ArcEveAR01_11
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: まてぇぇぇぇぇい！！逃げると申すかぁぁぁ！
msgctxt "ArcEveAR01_11"
msgid "Waaaaait! Are you trying to run away!?"
msgstr "Стрива-а-а-ай!! Ти що, тікаєш?!"

#. Key: ArcEveAR01_12
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: グハァっ！む、無念……ガク。
msgctxt "ArcEveAR01_12"
msgid "Gaaaaaaah! M-Mortified..."
msgstr "Ґха-а! Яка ганьба... Геп."

#. Key: ArcEveAR01_13
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Arakune
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: 捕　の　要　ない　　　。
#. JA:   　　く　まずそう　　　　。グヴヴ　　グヴヴ。
msgctxt "ArcEveAR01_13"
msgid ""
"No need     consu     him  .\n"
"     looks  eally nasty. Hguhguhguh..."
msgstr "Не ва то    пожи ати. Пе но, ги кий на смак. Ґву-ву... ґву-ву."

#. Key: ArcEveAR02_00
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Tager
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: まさかこんな所で出会うとは思わなかったぞ、久しぶりだな。
msgctxt "ArcEveAR02_00"
msgid ""
"I didn't think I'd bump into you here. \n"
"Long time no see."
msgstr ""
"Не думав, що зустріну тебе в такому місці. Давно не\n"
"бачилися."

#. Key: ArcEveAR02_01
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Arakune
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: 無機物　　　　。　　色にも属さない　　　対象外　。
#. JA:   　機物　さっさと去　　　　　。　ヴッ　ヴグ　ヴグ　ヴヴヴ……
msgctxt "ArcEveAR02_01"
msgid ""
"This  s   org  ni  .            consi  er            er col   .\n"
"   organ   mass sh                   hell ou      here.\n"
"Ghuhguh   hrk."
msgstr ""
"Неоргані на        . Не нале ить до жод ого ко  ору. Не ціль.\n"
"Неоргані на масо... заби айся. Ґв... ґву-ву..."

#. Key: ArcEveAR02_02
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Tager
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: 今のお前を見たらさぞかし嘆くだろう。
#. JA:   彼女だけではない、もちろんあいつも。
msgctxt "ArcEveAR02_02"
msgid ""
"If only they could see you now... How they would grieve...\n"
"Not only her, but Kokonoe as well."
msgstr ""
"Побачивши тебе таким, вона б страшенно засмутилася. І\n"
"не лише вона — Коконое, звісно, теж."

#. Key: ArcEveAR02_03
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Arakune
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: ううう　　ああ　コノエ、コ　ノエ　　！？グヴ　　ぐおおぉ
#. JA:   違う　　　　　僕　！　　違う違う違う違う違う違う！！
msgctxt "ArcEveAR02_03"
msgid ""
"Ugghh   augh       konoe,   id yo   say Ko   noe!?\n"
"Gggg   uggh...! Nooo, it's       like that! I—\n"
"NO            NO NO!"
msgstr ""
"У-у-у... А-а... Ко  ное, Ко  ноє!? Ґву... ґо-о-о... Ні,  не я! Не я,\n"
"не я, не я, не я, не я!!"

#. Key: ArcEveAR02_04
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Arakune
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: 　が！　当　　あああああ　くそう　蒼　　蒼　　　　！！
#. JA:   ちぐじょう　ぢぐ　　　ぐえ　ぐああああ　キヒヒヒヒ
msgctxt "ArcEveAR02_04"
msgid ""
"I'm   real  — Aaargh, dammit! T    Azure            Azure!\n"
"Damn        God               Gugh   arrrrggghh\n"
"Keeheeheeheehee "
msgstr ""
"Я! Це я... А-а-а-а, кля а Ла ур,     !! Кля а... Ґх, ґа-а-а!\n"
"Кі-хі-хі-хі!"

#. Key: ArcEveAR02_05
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Tager
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: 堕ちたな、
msgctxt "ArcEveAR02_05"
msgid "You've fallen..."
msgstr "Ти опустився..."

#. Key: ArcEveAR02_06
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Tager
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: グゥッ、不覚……これ以上お前をのさばらせるわけには。
msgctxt "ArcEveAR02_06"
msgid ""
"Ugh...impossible...\n"
"I can't let you roam around like this..."
msgstr ""
"Кх... Яка необачність... Не можна дозволити тобі й далі\n"
"чинити свавілля..."

#. Key: ArcEveAR02_07
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Arakune
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: 最　　らキサマ　食う　　ない　　　。
#. JA:   く　、　　な奴　　　。　よな　　　。
msgctxt "ArcEveAR02_07"
msgid ""
"  never inten          eat yo   from       start.\n"
"      damn idiot  . Goo  b      ."
msgstr ""
"Я від по атку не зби ався    же ти. Кля ий ду ень. Прощ\n"
"вай."

#. Key: ArcEveAR03_00
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Arakune
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: 見え　　　える　！近く　匂う　　！
#. JA:   　　これ　、これがワレ　蒼。求める蒼　　　
msgctxt "ArcEveAR03_00"
msgid ""
"        se   it!   can see   !         smell     near  !\n"
"     Azure    This          Az      I        look          !"
msgstr ""
"Ба у, ба у! Уже бли ько, чую за ах! Ось во а... моя Ла\n"
"ур.     , якої пра ну!"

#. Key: ArcEveAR03_01
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: 蟲よ、惹かれたか。
msgctxt "ArcEveAR03_01"
msgid "Are you captivated, insect?"
msgstr "Тебе вабить, комахо?"

#. Key: ArcEveAR03_02
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Arakune
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: ま　　人　いる　　　　ん　なぜ　　キサマ　　は色を感じない。
msgctxt "ArcEveAR03_02"
msgid ""
"D  n't think I would be caugh    \n"
"   Huh?        's       ?   don't feel    color              ."
msgstr ""
"Не ду ав, що   хтось є. Гм? Чо у я не відчу аю від тебе ко\n"
"ьору?"

#. Key: ArcEveAR03_03
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: 「境界」を越えて現世に戻った成れの果てか。
#. JA:   自らを代償に得た叡智は些かお前には重過ぎたようだ。
msgctxt "ArcEveAR03_03"
msgid ""
"So this is the result of passing through the Boundary and\n"
"into the present. It would appear you couldn't handle the\n"
"wisdom you gave your body for."
msgstr ""
"Ось на що ти перетворився, перейшовши Межу й\n"
"повернувшись у світ живих. Мудрість, за яку ти віддав\n"
"самого себе, виявилася для тебе надто важким тягарем."

#. Key: ArcEveAR03_04
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Arakune
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: う　　い　キサマ　や　り　　もので　ない　　　　　！
#. JA:   くそ　　　の蒼　横取　　　気か
msgctxt "ArcEveAR03_04"
msgid ""
"Shut       hell up. You     not              !\n"
"Damn   , are       planning to take       Azure!?"
msgstr ""
"Замов ни! Ти й справді незвичай ий! Кля ий, хочеш зава\n"
"ити    забра и Лазур?!"

#. Key: ArcEveAR03_05
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: 求める、か。姿形や存在する次元を問う前に、
#. JA:   お前と私は根本が同一なのやもしれぬ。
msgctxt "ArcEveAR03_05"
msgid ""
"Regardless of what we look like or what dimension we \n"
"exist in, deep down, you and I are very much the same."
msgstr ""
"Прагнення... Кажеш? Якщо не зважати на форму, подобу й\n"
"вимір, у якому ми існуємо, можливо, в самій основі ми з\n"
"тобою однакові."

#. Key: ArcEveAR03_06
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Arakune
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: 蒼、蒼だ、蒼があれば、僕は何者にも。
#. JA:   時間　来　しまう　蒼　　　　　　　　蒼　蒼　！
msgctxt "ArcEveAR03_06"
msgid ""
"Azure  it's       Azure. If   have      Azure, no one can...\n"
"      time     coming! Th   Azure is gushing in        Azure!"
msgstr ""
"Ла ур, це Ла ур. Якщо мати у Лазур, я ста у... Час набли\n"
"ається! Лазур вли ається... Лазур!     !"

#. Key: ArcEveAR03_07
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Arakune
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: キヒヒヒヒヒヒヒヒヒヒヒヒヒヒヒヒヒ
msgctxt "ArcEveAR03_07"
msgid "Keeheeheeheeheeheeheeheeheeheeheeheehee!"
msgstr "Кі-хі-хі-хі-хі-хі-хі-хі-хі-хі-хі-хі-хі-хі!"

#. Key: ArcEveAR03_08
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: 刻が来るか……為らば急がねば成るまい。
#. JA:   近し者よ、私の求める正義の前にお前は余りに穢れている。
msgctxt "ArcEveAR03_08"
msgid ""
"The time is fast approaching, then. We must hurry.\n"
"I'm afraid you're too corrupt to be part of the justice I\n"
"seek, my brother."
msgstr ""
"Час настає... Тоді треба поспішати. Споріднена мені істото,\n"
"ти надто заплямована для справедливості, якої я прагну."

#. Key: ArcEveAR03_09
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: 我は空、我は鋼、我は刃
#. JA:   我は一振りの剣にて全ての「罪」を刈り取り「悪」を滅する！！
msgctxt "ArcEveAR03_09"
msgid ""
"I am the white void. I am the cold steel. I am the just\n"
"sword. With blade in hand shall I reap the sins of this\n"
"world, and cleanse it in the fires of destruction."
msgstr ""
"Я — порожнеча. Я — сталь. Я — лезо... Єдиним мечем я\n"
"пожну всі «гріхи» та знищу «зло»!"

#. Key: ArcEveAR03_10
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: 我が名は「ハクメン」、推して参る！
msgctxt "ArcEveAR03_10"
msgid "I am Hakumen. The end has come!"
msgstr "Імʼя мені Хакумен. До бою!!!"

#. Key: ArcEveAR03_11
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: クッ、事象干渉か！邪魔をするな化け猫め！！！
msgctxt "ArcEveAR03_11"
msgid "Guh! How dare you interrupt me, Grimalkin!"
msgstr ""
"Кх, втручання у причинність! Не заважай, клята\n"
"відьомська кицько!!!"

#. Key: ArcEveAR03_12
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Arakune
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: 淀　　　感覚　　来る　こ　は蒼　蒼　蒼　！！
#. JA:   ああああ　歓喜　。　は歓喜　　　る。きひゃ　　あはは　あはは
msgctxt "ArcEveAR03_12"
msgid ""
"       stagnant feeling         coming! Thi  is Azure, Azure!\n"
"Ahhhh, how delightful!        incredible! Haha   ahahahah."
msgstr ""
"Кала утне відчу тя... набли ається! Це Ла ур,     , Лазур!!\n"
"А-а-а, яке бла енство. Це блажен тво. Кі-хя... А-ха-ха...\n"
"а-ха-ха!"

#. Key: ArcEveAR04_00
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: 起動・起動・起動・起動・認識……
msgctxt "ArcEveAR04_00"
msgid "Loading...loading...loading...loading... Complete..."
msgstr "Запуск. Запуск. Запуск. Запуск. Ідентифіковано..."

#. Key: ArcEveAR04_01
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Arakune
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: 待　　、ずっと待っていた　喰う　喰う　喰わせ　　　！
#. JA:   蒼を　どうか蒼を　蒼　　の血を！
msgctxt "ArcEveAR04_01"
msgid ""
"I've been waiting              en waiting    long time   !\n"
"The Azure, please                       azure blood of the beast!"
msgstr ""
"Че ав... так довго чекав. Же ти,     , дай зже ти! Ла ур...\n"
"прошу, Лазур... кров Лазурі!"

#. Key: ArcEveAR04_02
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: 対象・認識・自律モード・起動
msgctxt "ArcEveAR04_02"
msgid "Scanning: complete. Auto-mode: confirmed."
msgstr "Ціль ідентифіковано. Автономний режим активовано."

#. Key: ArcEveAR04_03
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Arakune
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: あぁあ　ああ　あは　グヴ　ヴ　ああはグヴああはきえ　やはは
msgctxt "ArcEveAR04_03"
msgid "Ahhh  Aah  Ahaha  Hguhguh   ghahahaha  Aaahahah "
msgstr "А-а-а... А-а... А-ха-ха... Ґву-ву... ґха-ха-ха... А-ха-ха!"

#. Key: ArcEveAR04_04
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: 対象・認識・障害・認識・排除・容認……対象を障害と認識。
msgctxt "ArcEveAR04_04"
msgid ""
"Scanning: complete. IFF determined. Processing... \n"
"Subject determined to be hostile."
msgstr ""
"Ціль ідентифіковано. Перешкоду ідентифіковано. Усунення\n"
"схвалено... Ціль ідентифіковано як перешкоду."

#. Key: ArcEveAR04_05
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Arakune
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: ぼくは　　ただ
msgctxt "ArcEveAR04_05"
msgid "I...just..."
msgstr "Я... ли е..."

#. Key: ArcEveAR04_06
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: 対象の殲滅を開始します
msgctxt "ArcEveAR04_06"
msgid "Now beginning termination of subject."
msgstr "Розпочинаю знищення цілі."

#. Key: ArcEveAR04_07
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Arakune
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: やつ
msgctxt "ArcEveAR04_07"
msgid "...wanted to surpass her...."
msgstr "Хотів перевершити її..."

#. Key: ArcEveAR05_00
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator (Arakune's journal)
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
msgctxt "ArcEveAR05_00"
msgid "AD 2196"
msgstr "2196 рік"

#. Key: ArcEveAR05_01
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator (Arakune's journal)
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: 1日目
msgctxt "ArcEveAR05_01"
msgid "Day 1"
msgstr "День 1"

#. Key: ArcEveAR05_02
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator (Arakune's journal)
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: 日誌を新調した。何にしても新しいものというのはいい。
msgctxt "ArcEveAR05_02"
msgid "I updated my journal today. New things are always very exciting."
msgstr "Завів новий журнал. Усе нове завжди тішить."

#. Key: ArcEveAR05_03_0
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator (Arakune's journal)
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: 今日は「魔素による魔素を消滅させるための素粒子の開発」という
msgctxt "ArcEveAR05_03_0"
msgid "Our meeting today was about using seithr to create weapons."
msgstr ""
"Сьогодні обговорювали «розроблення елементарних\n"
"частинок, що знищують ману за допомогою мани»."

#. Key: ArcEveAR05_03_1
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator (Arakune's journal)
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: 誰がいいだしたかも不明な、堂々巡りの議題について話し合う。
msgctxt "ArcEveAR05_03_1"
msgid "I have no idea who keeps bringing that up."
msgstr ""
"Не знаю, хто взагалі запропонував цю тему, але розмова\n"
"знову ходила по колу."

#. Key: ArcEveAR05_03_2
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator (Arakune's journal)
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: 岩のような顔に囲まれるのも、あの部屋の堅い椅子も苦手だ。
msgctxt "ArcEveAR05_03_2"
msgid "I hate sitting in that room, with its hard chairs and harder people."
msgstr ""
"Мені не до вподоби ні кам'яні пики навколо, ні тверді\n"
"стільці в тій кімнаті."

#. Key: ArcEveAR05_04
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator (Arakune's journal)
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: その話をしたら彼女はとても笑っていた。
#. JA:   そんなにおかしいことだとは思わなかったが、
#. JA:   あまりに笑うものだから僕も笑ってしまった。
msgctxt "ArcEveAR05_04"
msgid ""
"I told her the story, and she laughed.\n"
"I didn't think it was very funny, but her laughter was \n"
"so infectious, I found myself laughing too."
msgstr ""
"Я розповів їй про це, і вона дуже сміялася. Не думав, що це\n"
"аж так кумедно, але вона сміялася так заразливо, що я теж\n"
"не стримався."

#. Key: ArcEveAR05_05
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator (Arakune's journal)
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: 5日目
msgctxt "ArcEveAR05_05"
msgid "Day 5"
msgstr "День 5"

#. Key: ArcEveAR05_06_0
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator (Arakune's journal)
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: 随分気が滅入ってしまった
msgctxt "ArcEveAR05_06_0"
msgid "I feel really depressed."
msgstr "Настрій геть кепський."

#. Key: ArcEveAR05_06_1
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator (Arakune's journal)
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: それもこれも毎度のごとくあいつの言動のせいだ。
msgctxt "ArcEveAR05_06_1"
msgid "It's all because of something someone said to me."
msgstr "І все, як завжди, через її слова та вчинки."

#. Key: ArcEveAR05_07
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator (Arakune's journal)
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: 勘違いされているが、僕はココノエのことを嫌ってはいない。
#. JA:   僕自身やライチも世話になっているし、機関の保守派と違って
#. JA:   あいつの論を頑なに否定するつもりもない。
msgctxt "ArcEveAR05_07"
msgid ""
"People have me all wrong. I don't hate Kokonoe.\n"
"She took good care of Litchi and me, and unlike \n"
"the others here, I don't plan to denounce her theory."
msgstr ""
"Хоча всі думають інакше, я не ненавиджу Коконое. Вона\n"
"допомогла нам із Лічі, і, на відміну від консерваторів\n"
"Сектору Сім, я не заперечую вперто її теорію."

#. Key: ArcEveAR05_08
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator (Arakune's journal)
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: あいつの持つ才能や発想は常人には成しえないものだろう。
#. JA:   だから、それを無駄に腐らせているのに腹が立つんだ。
#. JA:   僕ならばって…………疲れるな。
msgctxt "ArcEveAR05_08"
msgid ""
"Her skills and her mind are way beyond what a normal \n"
"person can hope for. Putting that talent to waste just \n"
"pisses me off. If I had that kind of skill— ...Ugh. "
msgstr ""
"Її талант та ідеї недосяжні для пересічної людини. Тому\n"
"мене й дратує, що вона марнує такі здібності. На її місці я\n"
"б... Досить, я втомився."

#. Key: ArcEveAR05_09
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator (Arakune's journal)
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: 13日目
msgctxt "ArcEveAR05_09"
msgid "Day 13"
msgstr "День 13"

#. Key: ArcEveAR05_10
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator (Arakune's journal)
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: 最近胃を痛める出来事が連続している。
msgctxt "ArcEveAR05_10"
msgid "I've been getting a lot of stomachaches lately."
msgstr ""
"Останнім часом одна за одною трапляються події, від яких\n"
"мене нудить."

#. Key: ArcEveAR05_11
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator (Arakune's journal)
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: 彼女がそのたび、「またがんばろう」と
#. JA:   励ましてくれるのはありがたいけど、どうもな……。
#. JA:   どういうわけか彼女はあいつの真下でうまくやっているから。
msgctxt "ArcEveAR05_11"
msgid ""
"Every time it happens, she says, \"Hang in there,\" and \n"
"cheers me up. I'm grateful for it, but...\n"
"She seems to be doing really well working under her."
msgstr ""
"Щоразу вона підбадьорює мене словами «Спробуймо ще\n"
"раз», і я їй за це вдячний, але... Чомусь їй чудово\n"
"працюється безпосередньо під керівництвом Коконое."

#. Key: ArcEveAR05_12
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator (Arakune's journal)
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: うまくいかなくなるたびに自分が、ただの人間なんだって
#. JA:   いや、そう思いたくないから頑張ってんだろう……。
msgctxt "ArcEveAR05_12"
msgid ""
"Every time something doesn't go my way, I can't help \n"
"but think that it's because I'm just a human. No. \n"
"I can't think that. I'm trying my best, right...?"
msgstr ""
"Щоразу, коли щось не вдається, я думаю, що я лише\n"
"звичайна людина. Ні... Я ж стараюся саме тому, що не хочу\n"
"так думати..."

#. Key: ArcEveAR05_13
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator (Arakune's journal)
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: 19日目
msgctxt "ArcEveAR05_13"
msgid "Day 19"
msgstr "День 19"

#. Key: ArcEveAR05_14_0
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator (Arakune's journal)
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: ココノエがへんな実験動物をつれてきてからしばらく経つ。
msgctxt "ArcEveAR05_14_0"
msgid "Kokonoe hasn't brought in any test animals for a while."
msgstr ""
"Минув уже деякий час, відколи Коконое привела дивну\n"
"піддослідну тварину."

#. Key: ArcEveAR05_14_1
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator (Arakune's journal)
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: あの時は、イーゴにでも放り込むのかと思っていたら
msgctxt "ArcEveAR05_14_1"
msgid "I thought she'd just throw this one in Jotunheim,"
msgstr ""
"Тоді я подумав, що Коконое просто кине це створіння до\n"
"Іґо,"

#. Key: ArcEveAR05_14_2
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator (Arakune's journal)
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: これは自分の助手だとかいいだして驚いた。
msgctxt "ArcEveAR05_14_2"
msgid "but she told me it was her assistant."
msgstr "але вона заявила, що це її помічник. Я аж здивувався."

#. Key: ArcEveAR05_15
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator (Arakune's journal)
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: いや、なぜこんな化け物をと思ったが、
#. JA:   そんなことをいったら食われそうなのでおとなしくしておいた。
msgctxt "ArcEveAR05_15"
msgid ""
"I wondered why she chose a monster, but I was afraid \n"
"I'd get yelled at if I spoke up, so I kept quiet."
msgstr ""
"Я подумав: «Навіщо їй таке чудовисько?» Але змовчав —\n"
"інакше воно могло мене з'їсти."

#. Key: ArcEveAR05_16
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator (Arakune's journal)
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: しかも「まだ物知らずだから面倒をみろ」と
#. JA:   調査に同行させてきた。
msgctxt "ArcEveAR05_16"
msgid ""
"Still, if that wasn't bad enough, Kokonoe told me, \n"
"\"He's inexperienced, so please take care of him,\" and \n"
"made me take the creature along on my investigations."
msgstr ""
"А тоді Коконое сказала, що він іще недосвідчений і за ним\n"
"треба наглядати, та відправила його зі мною на\n"
"дослідження."

#. Key: ArcEveAR05_17
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator (Arakune's journal)
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: 話してみたところ知能はあるようだし
#. JA:   悪いやつではなかったから安心はしたが。
msgctxt "ArcEveAR05_17"
msgid ""
"I talked to the creature a little bit, and it doesn't\n"
"seem like a bad guy, so that's something..."
msgstr ""
"Поговоривши з ним, я заспокоївся: схоже, він розумний і\n"
"зовсім не лихий."

#. Key: ArcEveAR05_18
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator (Arakune's journal)
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: 今日はそいつといつもより会話を交わした。
#. JA:   常々思ってたことを忠告してやったら、
#. JA:   顔に似合わない深刻な顔をしていたな。
msgctxt "ArcEveAR05_18"
msgid ""
"I talked to her more than usual today, and told her \n"
"all the things I'd been worrying about lately.\n"
"She looked more serious than I'd seen her in a while."
msgstr ""
"Сьогодні я поговорив із ним більше, ніж зазвичай.\n"
"Висловив застереження, яке давно крутилося в голові, а\n"
"він зробив серйозне обличчя, яке йому зовсім не пасувало."

#. Key: ArcEveAR05_19
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator (Arakune's journal)
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: 思わずいい気味だと思ってしまった。
msgctxt "ArcEveAR05_19"
msgid "She got what she deserved."
msgstr "Мимоволі подумав: так йому й треба."

#. Key: ArcEveAR05_20
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator (Arakune's journal)
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: 32日目
msgctxt "ArcEveAR05_20"
msgid "Day 32"
msgstr "День 32"

#. Key: ArcEveAR05_21_0
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator (Arakune's journal)
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: 発見をした。
msgctxt "ArcEveAR05_21_0"
msgid "I've made a discovery."
msgstr "Я зробив відкриття."

#. Key: ArcEveAR05_21_1
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator (Arakune's journal)
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: 劇的なものだったからつい日を忘れて没頭した。
msgctxt "ArcEveAR05_21_1"
msgid "I was so immersed, I completely lost track of the time."
msgstr ""
"Відкриття було настільки разючим, що я поринув у роботу\n"
"й забув, який нині день."

#. Key: ArcEveAR05_21_2
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator (Arakune's journal)
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: 大体の考えはレポートにまとめたが、ここにも軽く書いておこう。
msgctxt "ArcEveAR05_21_2"
msgid "I wrote most of it in my report, but I'll put some of it here too."
msgstr ""
"Основні міркування я виклав у звіті, але дещо коротко\n"
"занотую і тут."

#. Key: ArcEveAR05_22_0
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator (Arakune's journal)
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: 現在正体が不明なまま体よく人間に使われている魔素だが、
msgctxt "ArcEveAR05_22_0"
msgid "It's regarding the seithr people often use, but don't  understand."
msgstr ""
"Нині люди зручно користуються маною, досі не знаючи її\n"
"справжньої природи."

#. Key: ArcEveAR05_22_1
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator (Arakune's journal)
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: あれを前時代の御伽噺の実現だの
msgctxt "ArcEveAR05_22_1"
msgid "Some suggest it's the realization of fairly tales"
msgstr "Кажуть, ніби вона втілює давні казки"

#. Key: ArcEveAR05_22_2
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator (Arakune's journal)
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: 生命力から変換された魔法だのといっているがそれは違う。
msgctxt "ArcEveAR05_22_2"
msgid "or the result of human sacrifice, but they're all wrong."
msgstr "або є магією, перетвореною з життєвої сили, але це не так."

#. Key: ArcEveAR05_23
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveAR_ArcEveAR05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveAR.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator (Arakune's journal)
#. Context: Arcade event: Arakune
#. JA: 魔素とは「粒子型のプログラム」。
#. JA:   そう、だから術式を否定しているココノエは知らない。
#. JA:   自ら答えを避けているなどと夢にも思うまい。
msgctxt "ArcEveAR05_23"
msgid ""
"Seithr is actually a kind of nanomachine.\n"
"That's right! Kokonoe doesn't believe in using Armagus.\n"
"She'd never believe this could be the answer."
msgstr ""
"Мана — це «програма частинкового типу». Саме тому\n"
"Коконое, яка заперечує магічні формули, цього не знає. Їй і\n"
"на думку не спаде, що вона сама уникає відповіді."

